warning[single_case_switch]: this `switch` has a single case
  --> tests/lint/single_case_switch/bad.jai:10:5
   |
10 |     if mode == {
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write an `if` instead
   |
 9   announce :: (mode: Mode) {
10 ~     if mode == .VERBOSE {
11 ~         print("loud\n");
12 -             print("loud\n");
13       }
   |
   = note: `single_case_switch` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/single_case_switch

